1
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:15,682
AS YOU STOOD BY

2
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:20,353
EP 04
EUN-SU DAN HUI-SU

3
00:00:57,015 --> 00:00:58,224
Dia sudah pulang?

4
00:01:00,143 --> 00:01:00,977
Apa-apaan ini?

5
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:18,411
Apa ada masalah? Tumben pulang cepat.

6
00:01:19,621 --> 00:01:21,623
Apa-apaan tiket pesawat itu?

7
00:01:24,709 --> 00:01:26,795
- Tiket pesawat apa?
- Ke Shanghai. Besok.

8
00:01:27,462 --> 00:01:30,048
Tiket sekali jalan untukku. Apa-apaan itu?

9
00:01:30,632 --> 00:01:31,966
Aku tak mengerti.

10
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:34,761
Katakan. Kau tidak tahu?

11
00:01:53,988 --> 00:01:55,657
Jadi, ada yang direncanakan.

12
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,744
Eun-su baru mau pergi.

13
00:02:21,516 --> 00:02:22,725
Sayang, ada apa?

14
00:02:49,419 --> 00:02:51,588
Wah, wah. Apa ini?

15
00:02:52,297 --> 00:02:53,339
Mau apa kalian?

16
00:02:56,718 --> 00:02:57,969
Hentikan!

17
00:02:58,678 --> 00:03:00,680
Sialan. Keluarlah.

18
00:03:04,893 --> 00:03:06,144
Bukan main.

19
00:03:06,769 --> 00:03:07,604
Bangun.

20
00:03:09,772 --> 00:03:10,607
Berhenti.

21
00:03:15,778 --> 00:03:16,613
Wow.

22
00:03:24,913 --> 00:03:27,874
Bangun. Hei, apa rencanamu?

23
00:03:31,961 --> 00:03:33,296
Sialan!

24
00:03:35,298 --> 00:03:36,674
Hentikan! Sudah.

25
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:50,355
Mau apa kalian berdua?

26
00:03:50,438 --> 00:03:52,523
Hei, Jo Eun-su. Lihat aku.

27
00:03:55,151 --> 00:03:57,153
Sudah kuperingatkan, 'kan?

28
00:03:57,654 --> 00:04:00,156
Jangan campuri urusan suami istri.

29
00:05:05,805 --> 00:05:06,639
Hei.

30
00:05:10,101 --> 00:05:11,769
Kalian akan membunuhku dengan ini?

31
00:05:12,729 --> 00:05:15,356
Bagaimana caranya? Seperti ini?

32
00:05:17,275 --> 00:05:18,818
- Seperti ini?
- Lepaskan!

33
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:20,403
- Kau.
- Lepaskan!

34
00:05:21,571 --> 00:05:22,447
Apa kau tahu?

35
00:05:24,198 --> 00:05:26,617
Aku ini abadi, dengar?

36
00:05:27,618 --> 00:05:28,995
Ayo. Cobalah bunuh aku.

37
00:05:29,954 --> 00:05:32,957
Kau harus mati. Matilah, sialan!

38
00:05:35,251 --> 00:05:36,461
Matilah!

39
00:06:11,162 --> 00:06:13,998
Jangan, Hui-su! Hentikan.

40
00:06:17,877 --> 00:06:18,711
Sialan.

41
00:07:11,264 --> 00:07:14,434
Eun-su, kau harus pergi.
Anggap kau tak pernah kemari.

42
00:07:15,101 --> 00:07:15,977
Apa maksudmu?

43
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:18,938
- Kulakukan ini sendiri.
- Tidak, kita bersama.

44
00:07:19,021 --> 00:07:20,231
Eun-su!

45
00:07:22,442 --> 00:07:23,693
Tetap sesuai rencana.

46
00:07:24,193 --> 00:07:26,612
Pak Jang akan pergi besok sesuai rencana.

47
00:07:27,363 --> 00:07:30,450
Lalu kita kubur Noh Jin-pyo,
maka semua ini berakhir.

48
00:08:05,026 --> 00:08:05,985
Fokuslah.

49
00:08:38,017 --> 00:08:38,976
Halo.

50
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:41,771
Aku punya jeruk di rumah,
jadi kubawakan beberapa.

51
00:08:42,688 --> 00:08:44,232
Aku baru saja membeli ini,

52
00:08:44,315 --> 00:08:46,567
tapi kedaluwarsanya hari ini,
jadi ingin kubagi.

53
00:08:47,902 --> 00:08:51,239
Maaf, tapi aku sedang pilek.

54
00:08:51,322 --> 00:08:54,283
Bisakah kau taruh itu
di depan pintu? Terima kasih.

55
00:09:23,938 --> 00:09:26,983
MAAF, SUDAH MENGGORES MOBILMU
TELEPON AKU, UNIT 1410

56
00:09:29,569 --> 00:09:31,904
Bagaimana jika dia tahu perbuatan kita?

57
00:09:33,698 --> 00:09:34,991
Bagaimana mungkin?

58
00:09:35,616 --> 00:09:37,577
Dia tahu aku sering dipukuli.

59
00:09:44,083 --> 00:09:46,877
Meski begitu,
dia pasti cuma mengecek keadaanmu.

60
00:09:46,961 --> 00:09:48,629
Dia bahkan berikan nomornya.

61
00:09:49,422 --> 00:09:52,883
Bagaimana jika kemudian dia tahu
dan memanggil polisi?

62
00:09:53,801 --> 00:09:58,306
Dia tak melihat apa pun untuk dilaporkan.
Kita harus tetap pada rencana.

63
00:10:24,707 --> 00:10:25,875
Mereka begitu lagi?

64
00:10:25,958 --> 00:10:27,376
Kali ini agak berbeda.

65
00:10:27,877 --> 00:10:30,588
Tadi aku ke unit itu,
dan sepertinya ada tamu.

66
00:10:30,671 --> 00:10:33,382
- Kenapa kau ke sana?
- Untuk memberikan jeruk.

67
00:10:34,467 --> 00:10:36,636
Sayang. Ayo makan topoki.

68
00:10:37,261 --> 00:10:39,138
- Sekarang?
- Aku tiba-tiba mau.

69
00:10:39,221 --> 00:10:40,139
Aku baru mandi.

70
00:10:40,222 --> 00:10:41,891
Lebih enak makan di tempat.

71
00:10:41,974 --> 00:10:44,810
Hyeon-ji! Ayo keluar
untuk makan tteok-twi-sun!

72
00:11:28,771 --> 00:11:29,689
Biar aku saja.

73
00:11:32,775 --> 00:11:33,651
Baiklah.

74
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:56,716
SELALU DAN SELAMANYA
26-02-2020

75
00:12:36,046 --> 00:12:38,674
Bersedia, siap, mulai.

76
00:12:38,758 --> 00:12:42,595
Teman-teman menjalani hidup bersama

77
00:12:42,678 --> 00:12:46,140
Meski hari-hari di masa lalu
Berlalu dan takkan kembali

78
00:12:46,223 --> 00:12:49,935
Sepatah kata bisa bertahan seumur hidup

79
00:12:50,019 --> 00:12:51,812
Dan di dalam segelas arak…

80
00:12:53,689 --> 00:12:55,191
Ayo. Duduklah kembali!

81
00:12:59,528 --> 00:13:00,529
Sampai jumpa!

82
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:13,459
Sudah kubayar mahal. Makanlah lagi.

83
00:13:14,376 --> 00:13:16,629
Ya, Pak. Semuanya bersenang-senang.

84
00:13:16,712 --> 00:13:19,298
Kapan lagi kau akan makan
masakan Korea yang autentik?

85
00:13:37,983 --> 00:13:39,568
Kenapa pulang tiba-tiba?

86
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:42,196
Ada masalah di rumah?

87
00:13:47,284 --> 00:13:48,786
Aku hanya rindu putraku.

88
00:13:59,296 --> 00:14:00,548
Mau bagaimana lagi.

89
00:14:07,012 --> 00:14:07,847
Naik kapal?

90
00:14:09,515 --> 00:14:10,558
Siap dan aman?

91
00:14:11,141 --> 00:14:13,519
Kau berangkat dari mana? Pyeongtaek?

92
00:14:15,271 --> 00:14:16,105
Gunsan?

93
00:14:22,278 --> 00:14:23,112
Incheon?

94
00:14:23,195 --> 00:14:24,196
Ya.

95
00:14:25,322 --> 00:14:26,949
Keamanannya ketat di sana.

96
00:14:27,032 --> 00:14:29,201
Dermaga bahkan diperiksa juga.

97
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:37,293
Pelabuhan Incheon,
bukan Bandara Incheon, benar?

98
00:14:38,377 --> 00:14:39,420
Tentu bukan.

99
00:14:41,922 --> 00:14:45,551
Lagi pula, kau tak bisa naik pesawat
meski kau mau.

100
00:14:48,888 --> 00:14:51,473
Jika kau lari dari masalah,
aku tak bisa melindungimu.

101
00:14:52,808 --> 00:14:54,018
Bukan seperti itu.

102
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:56,228
Kau sudah beri tahu Jo Eun-su

103
00:14:58,022 --> 00:14:59,064
bahwa kau pergi?

104
00:15:05,404 --> 00:15:07,948
Siapa Jo Eun-su, Pak?

105
00:15:17,041 --> 00:15:19,752
Dia pernah ke gudang kita.
Kukira kalian pernah bertemu.

106
00:15:20,419 --> 00:15:23,213
- Masuklah. Aku masih ingin merokok.
- Ya, Pak.

107
00:15:57,665 --> 00:16:00,250
PAK JIN SO-BAEK

108
00:16:14,682 --> 00:16:15,933
PAK JANG KANG

109
00:16:48,382 --> 00:16:49,383
MEMATIKAN PONSEL

110
00:16:51,427 --> 00:16:53,929
MENGATUR ULANG PERANGKAT

111
00:17:40,642 --> 00:17:42,478
Semua ini sudah dicuci semalam.

112
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:44,438
Kupikir perlu dicuci lagi.

113
00:17:49,818 --> 00:17:52,237
Seluruh rumah ini bau parfum.

114
00:17:53,489 --> 00:17:55,908
Kupikir perlu disemprot parfum.
Apa terlalu menyengat?

115
00:17:57,159 --> 00:17:59,119
Kita sudah menyemprotnya kemarin.

116
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:05,000
Aroma harum bisa bikin nyaman.

117
00:18:10,881 --> 00:18:12,007
Kau menghapus ponselnya?

118
00:18:13,634 --> 00:18:14,468
Ya.

119
00:18:22,935 --> 00:18:23,769
Halo?

120
00:18:25,771 --> 00:18:26,605
Sudah?

121
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:34,279
Aku terbangun lebih awal.

122
00:18:35,239 --> 00:18:36,073
Masuklah.

123
00:18:54,424 --> 00:18:55,676
Ini rumah yang bagus.

124
00:18:56,677 --> 00:18:57,970
Wangi juga.

125
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,993
Aku memintamu kemari
untuk memberimu setelan lain.

126
00:19:21,076 --> 00:19:21,910
Itu cocok untukmu.

127
00:19:24,746 --> 00:19:25,706
Terima kasih.

128
00:19:27,457 --> 00:19:28,542
Untuk tasnya juga.

129
00:19:30,210 --> 00:19:33,255
Aku akan memberimu paspor di bandara.
Hanya ini barangmu?

130
00:19:34,798 --> 00:19:38,635
Ya. Selain yang kau berikan padaku,
bawaanku tidak banyak.

131
00:19:42,931 --> 00:19:45,767
Sudah kupesankan taksi. Kau bisa bawa ini.

132
00:19:46,435 --> 00:19:47,311
Baik.

133
00:19:53,275 --> 00:19:54,985
Taksimu akan segera datang.

134
00:20:00,073 --> 00:20:00,908
Ini…

135
00:20:14,087 --> 00:20:14,922
Astaga.

136
00:20:22,054 --> 00:20:23,013
Biar kupakaikan.

137
00:20:38,862 --> 00:20:39,696
Wow.

138
00:20:40,781 --> 00:20:41,615
Terima kasih.

139
00:20:42,574 --> 00:20:43,700
Baiklah.

140
00:20:48,038 --> 00:20:49,957
Kalau begitu, sampai nanti.

141
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:50,874
Baiklah.

142
00:21:18,151 --> 00:21:20,529
Lantai satu. Pintu akan tertutup.

143
00:21:49,308 --> 00:21:50,309
Di sana.

144
00:21:50,392 --> 00:21:52,019
Turunkan aku di sana.

145
00:22:02,362 --> 00:22:03,363
Nanti kutelepon.

146
00:22:31,099 --> 00:22:33,018
PEMBERITAHUAN PELANGGARAN PARKIR

147
00:23:07,928 --> 00:23:09,262
Kantong plastik hitam.

148
00:23:19,815 --> 00:23:20,649
Eun-su?

149
00:23:25,153 --> 00:23:26,029
Ini aku.

150
00:23:35,247 --> 00:23:36,289
Jin-young.

151
00:23:37,457 --> 00:23:38,834
Kau menunggu seseorang?

152
00:23:39,418 --> 00:23:42,295
Cuma gadis di lantai bawah.
Dia membawa wadah makananku.

153
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:47,300
Kalian pasti sangat dekat
sampai kau membuka pintu tanpa alas kaki.

154
00:23:51,138 --> 00:23:53,390
Kakak memakai sepatu kets seperti ini?

155
00:23:53,890 --> 00:23:57,102
Dia hanya memakainya
saat bekerja sukarela.

156
00:23:57,978 --> 00:23:59,062
Dia memang begitu.

157
00:23:59,813 --> 00:24:01,314
Boleh aku ke kamar mandi?

158
00:24:02,274 --> 00:24:05,110
Mungkin bakal agak berantakan.
Tak apa-apa, 'kan?

159
00:24:05,193 --> 00:24:06,027
Tentu.

160
00:24:27,257 --> 00:24:29,217
Sejak kapan ada darah di jaketku?

161
00:24:41,897 --> 00:24:42,772
Bau apa ini?

162
00:24:43,732 --> 00:24:46,276
Aku menumpahkan pengharum ruangan tadi.

163
00:24:46,943 --> 00:24:47,777
Baiklah.

164
00:24:50,363 --> 00:24:51,740
Duduklah di sofa.

165
00:24:51,823 --> 00:24:53,325
Aku harus segera pergi.

166
00:25:02,876 --> 00:25:04,252
Kaus kakiku bersih.

167
00:25:04,336 --> 00:25:05,629
Kau mau kopi?

168
00:25:06,755 --> 00:25:07,589
Tentu.

169
00:25:18,725 --> 00:25:20,352
Apa Kakak sedang bekerja?

170
00:25:21,811 --> 00:25:23,605
Aku menelepon dia saat kemari,

171
00:25:24,189 --> 00:25:25,524
tapi kurasa dia sibuk.

172
00:25:26,024 --> 00:25:27,442
Apa ada masalah?

173
00:25:34,241 --> 00:25:35,200
Tidak juga.

174
00:25:35,283 --> 00:25:36,493
Cuma ingin tahu kabar.

175
00:25:38,245 --> 00:25:40,121
Aku minum air putih saja sebelum pergi.

176
00:25:54,094 --> 00:25:56,346
Sepertinya ini pelakunya.

177
00:25:59,182 --> 00:26:00,308
Benar.

178
00:26:01,309 --> 00:26:02,852
Ada pecahan kaca di sini.

179
00:26:04,521 --> 00:26:06,147
Biar kuambilkan air putih.

180
00:26:13,738 --> 00:26:14,573
Omong-omong,

181
00:26:15,407 --> 00:26:18,493
bukankah seharusnya
ada banyak foto di sana?

182
00:26:24,749 --> 00:26:25,834
Kalian bertengkar?

183
00:26:28,628 --> 00:26:29,462
Airmu.

184
00:27:46,164 --> 00:27:47,165
Masuklah.

185
00:28:24,536 --> 00:28:25,704
NOH JIN-PYO

186
00:28:26,746 --> 00:28:29,541
Anda pasti menemukan
peluang investasi yang bagus, Pak.

187
00:28:48,685 --> 00:28:49,894
REPUBLIK KOREA
PASPOR

188
00:29:00,238 --> 00:29:02,782
NOH JIN-PYO

189
00:29:16,004 --> 00:29:17,797
Ini pin untuk kopernya.

190
00:29:30,185 --> 00:29:32,061
ROBOT TEMPUR

191
00:29:57,128 --> 00:30:00,799
Kak Jin-pyo, aku sedang ditinjau
untuk kantor kepresidenan…

192
00:30:01,424 --> 00:30:04,886
Mereka juga memeriksa keluarga.
Tolong jauhi masalah.

193
00:30:05,970 --> 00:30:07,180
HAPUS PESAN

194
00:30:26,407 --> 00:30:27,617
Tidak mungkin.

195
00:30:29,452 --> 00:30:31,913
Kakak tak mungkin memukulnya
dengan bola kristal salju.

196
00:30:42,924 --> 00:30:45,009
Terutama dalam kehidupan pribadimu.

197
00:30:47,637 --> 00:30:48,471
HAPUS PESAN

198
00:31:08,700 --> 00:31:09,534
Ya?

199
00:31:10,451 --> 00:31:14,122
Sesampainya di Shanghai,
gunakan jalur imigrasi orang asing.

200
00:31:15,623 --> 00:31:16,457
Tentu.

201
00:31:23,923 --> 00:31:27,260
Begitu kau mendarat,
nyalakan, lalu matikan, dan buang.

202
00:31:28,344 --> 00:31:31,389
- Aku mengerti.
- Dan jangan menoleh ke belakang.

203
00:31:31,973 --> 00:31:33,933
Selamat tinggal, Pak Noh Jin-pyo.

204
00:32:01,753 --> 00:32:03,922
- Halo?
- Pak Jang baru masuk.

205
00:32:06,007 --> 00:32:06,841
Baiklah.

206
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:10,720
Adik Noh Jin-pyo
mengirim pesan ke ponselnya.

207
00:32:12,138 --> 00:32:13,348
Dia datang tadi.

208
00:32:14,265 --> 00:32:15,516
Apa? Kenapa?

209
00:32:16,517 --> 00:32:18,144
Dia melihat bola kristal salju itu.

210
00:32:19,103 --> 00:32:22,607
Itu tak berkaitan dengan isi pesannya,
jadi jangan khawatir.

211
00:32:23,858 --> 00:32:26,903
Dia meminta Jin-pyo menjaga
kehidupan pribadinya sebelum penugasan.

212
00:32:27,487 --> 00:32:29,614
Jadi, memang ada yang dirahasiakan.

213
00:32:33,034 --> 00:32:33,868
Baiklah.

214
00:36:47,538 --> 00:36:49,040
Aku baru mau pergi.

215
00:36:50,082 --> 00:36:54,045
Sudah banyak orang yang bilang begitu,
tapi tak benar-benar pergi.

216
00:36:54,128 --> 00:36:57,632
Jika anggota asosiasi penghuni melihatku
mengabaikan ini, aku bisa dipecat.

217
00:36:57,715 --> 00:37:00,676
Aku mengerti,
tapi temanku sedang turun ke sini.

218
00:37:01,177 --> 00:37:02,553
Blok dan unit berapa?

219
00:37:04,305 --> 00:37:05,431
Yang ini. Blok 2.

220
00:37:06,933 --> 00:37:08,726
Sumpah, dia akan segera turun.

221
00:37:09,894 --> 00:37:10,728
Tolonglah.

222
00:37:10,811 --> 00:37:11,896
Apa-apaan kau?

223
00:37:11,979 --> 00:37:13,648
- Maaf, Pak. Tolonglah.
- Kenapa…

224
00:37:13,731 --> 00:37:14,565
Eun-su.

225
00:37:16,234 --> 00:37:17,735
Bu Jo. Silakan masuk.

226
00:37:17,818 --> 00:37:19,528
Biar kulepaskan stikernya.

227
00:37:24,742 --> 00:37:26,619
Kami buru-buru. Terima kasih.

228
00:37:26,702 --> 00:37:27,662
Baik, Bu.

229
00:37:45,805 --> 00:37:47,014
Sebentar, Hui-su.

230
00:38:09,036 --> 00:38:09,870
Ayo berangkat.

231
00:38:47,366 --> 00:38:48,451
Ayo lebih cepat.

232
00:38:49,243 --> 00:38:51,912
Tak boleh kecelakaan
karena kita tak bisa hubungi asuransi.

233
00:38:52,788 --> 00:38:54,123
Atau ke rumah sakit.

234
00:38:58,210 --> 00:39:01,797
Aku ingin cepat merasa lega.
Aku ingin ini cepat selesai.

235
00:39:28,491 --> 00:39:29,825
Hui-su, ada apa?

236
00:39:31,243 --> 00:39:32,078
Apanya?

237
00:39:32,953 --> 00:39:35,081
Ada sesuatu di tanganmu?

238
00:39:35,998 --> 00:39:37,958
Telapak tanganku berkeringat.

239
00:39:44,090 --> 00:39:45,966
Kau yakin baik-baik saja?

240
00:39:47,259 --> 00:39:48,094
Ya.

241
00:39:53,849 --> 00:39:55,726
Jangan begitu, Hui-su.

242
00:39:56,227 --> 00:39:58,521
Tak ada apa-apa di tanganmu.

243
00:40:00,314 --> 00:40:01,941
Baik, akan kuhentikan.

244
00:41:17,475 --> 00:41:19,477
- Apa yang lucu?
- Ini kocak, 'kan?

245
00:41:21,812 --> 00:41:23,606
Sialan. Itu tempat biasa kita.

246
00:43:23,726 --> 00:43:25,728
Dia pasti datang saat larut malam.

247
00:45:30,644 --> 00:45:32,980
Anda meninggalkan rute yang ditetapkan.

248
00:45:36,442 --> 00:45:38,861
Anda meninggalkan rute yang ditetapkan.

249
00:47:38,480 --> 00:47:39,898
Aku akan beli minuman.

250
00:48:08,635 --> 00:48:10,596
Permisi. Aku ingin bayar.

251
00:48:19,771 --> 00:48:21,106
Berapa harga yang ini?

252
00:48:22,441 --> 00:48:23,901
Itu? Harganya 5.000 won.

253
00:49:43,814 --> 00:49:44,940
Kau pasti lapar.

254
00:49:45,023 --> 00:49:46,024
Kurasa begitu.

255
00:49:48,610 --> 00:49:49,736
Baiklah.

256
00:49:51,071 --> 00:49:53,323
- Selamat makan.
- Terima kasih.

257
00:49:58,203 --> 00:50:00,622
Aku tak perlu membuang buihnya, 'kan?

258
00:50:00,706 --> 00:50:02,666
Tak ada orang yang melakukan itu.

259
00:50:04,626 --> 00:50:05,460
Benar?

260
00:50:09,965 --> 00:50:10,966
Ayo makan.

261
00:50:15,178 --> 00:50:17,222
Ini pasti menggunakan beras lokal.

262
00:50:17,305 --> 00:50:19,516
Nasinya sempurna. Sangat lezat.

263
00:50:19,599 --> 00:50:20,600
Pelan-pelan saja.

264
00:50:21,935 --> 00:50:25,063
Aku mungkin akan tambah
semangkuk nasi lagi nanti.

265
00:50:25,564 --> 00:50:26,398
Baiklah.

266
00:50:37,993 --> 00:50:38,827
Hui-su.

267
00:50:39,995 --> 00:50:40,829
Hui-su?

268
00:50:42,539 --> 00:50:44,374
Kau yakin tak butuh bantuan?

269
00:50:44,458 --> 00:50:45,667
Ya, aku tak apa-apa.

270
00:50:46,334 --> 00:50:47,753
Bisa kau tutup pintunya?

271
00:50:58,805 --> 00:51:00,348
Bu, kami ingin bayar.

272
00:51:01,224 --> 00:51:02,184
Sebentar.

273
00:51:10,358 --> 00:51:11,568
Harganya 25.000 won.

274
00:51:13,612 --> 00:51:14,613
Baik.

275
00:51:19,951 --> 00:51:20,869
Ini.

276
00:51:32,506 --> 00:51:33,965
Kau sanggup pulang?

277
00:51:40,180 --> 00:51:41,681
Kurasa begitu, tapi…

278
00:51:44,142 --> 00:51:45,519
Aku tidak mau pergi.

279
00:53:18,236 --> 00:53:19,487
Tidurmu nyenyak?

280
00:53:20,739 --> 00:53:21,573
Ya.

281
00:53:25,160 --> 00:53:26,286
Kita harus kembali.

282
00:53:29,873 --> 00:53:30,707
Ya.

283
00:53:35,295 --> 00:53:38,423
Mulai saat ini,
banyak yang harus kau hadapi sendiri.

284
00:53:41,009 --> 00:53:41,843
Aku tahu.

285
00:53:49,601 --> 00:53:51,853
Tapi Jo Eun-su, nomor absen 35,
akan mendukungmu.

286
00:53:55,148 --> 00:53:58,235
Dan Jo Hui-su, nomor absen 36,
juga akan mendukungmu.

287
00:54:06,993 --> 00:54:08,536
Bisa kita nyalakan ponsel?

288
00:54:09,246 --> 00:54:10,080
Ya.

289
00:54:18,630 --> 00:54:21,049
PANGGILAN TAK TERJAWAB, PESAN TERLEWATKAN

290
00:54:36,273 --> 00:54:37,524
PAK JANG KANG

291
00:54:48,451 --> 00:54:50,412
PUDONG, SHANGHAI

292
00:54:50,495 --> 00:54:52,622
Pak Jang Kang sampai dengan selamat.

293
00:54:54,708 --> 00:54:56,042
Astaga, syukurlah.

294
00:55:20,233 --> 00:55:22,777
- Aduh.
- Sepatumu bagus.

295
00:55:23,653 --> 00:55:24,821
Tapi itu… Apa itu?

296
00:55:24,904 --> 00:55:26,323
Ada apa, Sayang?

297
00:55:27,032 --> 00:55:28,825
Apa? Kenapa ini agak ambles?

298
00:55:29,409 --> 00:55:30,243
Hati-hati.

299
00:55:31,119 --> 00:55:32,329
Astaga, apa-apaan…

300
00:55:33,747 --> 00:55:35,248
Kau sungguh ingin pulang?

301
00:55:48,678 --> 00:55:51,139
PUTRAKU

302
00:56:21,503 --> 00:56:25,048
Ada tabrakan parah di depan.
Tolong beri jalan untuk ambulans, Bu.

303
00:56:26,674 --> 00:56:28,259
Pindah ke samping!

304
00:56:28,968 --> 00:56:30,470
Pasti ada kecelakaan.

305
00:56:31,137 --> 00:56:32,639
Apa ambulans sudah dekat?

306
00:57:06,089 --> 00:57:07,465
Ada darah di mobilmu.

307
00:57:07,966 --> 00:57:09,592
Benar, itu darah rusa air.

308
00:57:09,676 --> 00:57:10,510
Rusa air?

309
00:57:11,136 --> 00:57:16,266
Ya, aku tak sengaja menabraknya
saat pergi ke makam keluarga.

310
00:57:23,648 --> 00:57:25,066
Biar kuperiksa bagasimu.

311
00:57:29,779 --> 00:57:30,613
Tidak bisa.

312
00:57:35,201 --> 00:57:36,870
Tolong kerja samanya, Bu.

313
00:57:39,622 --> 00:57:41,332
Tolong buka bagasinya, Bu.

314
00:57:44,878 --> 00:57:45,879
Bu?

315
01:00:52,607 --> 01:00:57,612
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Luhur Pambudi
